# Cloudflare Pages: rewrite dynamic [id] routes to the single built page; keep /students/new (enroll) as-is.
# First matching rule wins – so list /students/new before the catch-all.
/students/new   /students/new   200
/students/new/  /students/new   200
/students/*     /students/0     200
/bulk-upload    /bulk-upload    200
/leads/*        /leads/0        200
/activities/*   /activities/0   200
